Clean-room statement: mddbmeta's file parsers and algorithms are written
independently from public file-format documentation (the AMBER reference
manual, the NetCDF AMBER conventions, and MDDB-workflow's documented inputs
schema). No source code from the AmberMeta project (BUSL-1.1) is imported,
copied, or ported. The package must never depend on or import `ambermeta`;
tests/test_clean_room.py enforces this.
